   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **ween20170421matrix24 bit01**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [4]\n- **ween20170421matrix24 bit02**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [4]\n- **ween20170421matrix24 bit03**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [4]\n- **ween20170421matrix24 bit04**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [4]\n- **ween20170421matrix24 bit05**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [4]\n- **ween20170421matrix24 bit06**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [4]\n- **ween20170421matrix24 bit07**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [4]\n- **ween20170421matrix24 bit08**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [4]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **ween2017-04-21.matrix.24bit** (recommended): matrix (soundboard mixed with audience mics); 28 songs; 137 min [1]. Said about its sound: Some songs are cut at the start due to an equipment problem; the first two tracks use only the Nakamichi source [1]\n- **ween2017-04-21.nak302.24bit**: source not stated; 27 songs; 137 min [2]\n- **ween2017-04-21.ca11.24bit.partial**: source not stated; 25 songs; 127 min [3]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **ween2017-04-21.matrix.24bit**: taped by J.Barnes; transferred by J.Barnes; source: nakamichi cm300 (cp2) + ca-11 > tascam dr-60d mkII [1]. Also: Recorded with Nakamichi CM300 (CP2) plus Church Audio CA-11 mics into a Tascam DR-60D mkII, from an SD card; Transfer chain: Reaper 2.4, then WaveLab 6, CDWave, and FLAC level 8 [1]\n- **ween2017-04-21.nak302.24bit**: taped by J.Barnes; source: nakamichi cm300 (cp2) > tascam dr-60d mkII [2]\n- **ween2017-04-21.ca11.24bit.partial**: taped by J.Barnes; transferred by J.Barnes; source: church audio ca-11 > tascam dr-60d mkII [3]",
